k4-pihole's test fixtures: api/ is a fake Pi-hole v6 (pihole.py with K4_PIHOLE_FAKE=a copy of it; files
named by the API path, / as _; the app password is $K4_PIHOLE_PASSWORD; unbound.json is what ssh would say). Invented
clients and domains. tests/bar.sh runs it; tests/menu/pihole*.txt are its pages.
